      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You can frame the mask's complexity through its function within its community, emphasizing the sophisticated social structures it represents. Instead of \"feeling,\" describe the intricate symbolism of the geometric patterns as a highly developed visual language specific to that culture. This approach allows you to acknowledge the intellectual rigor of its design without equating it to the European tradition's theological framework.",
      "source": "target",
